    "chapterTitle": "The Pequod Meets The Bachelor",
    "quote": "Signals, ensigns, and jacks of all colours were flying from her rigging, on every side.",
    "quotes": [
      {"chapter":115,"text":"long streamers of narrow red bunting at their hats"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"glad holiday apparel"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"nailed to her main truck was a brazen lamp"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"the olive-hued girls"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"the widely-separated ships"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"a full ship and homeward-bound"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"the barbarian sound of enormous drums"},
      {"chapter":115,"text":"glittering fiddle-bows of whale ivory"}
